===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|zoology}} A member of the subfamily {{taxfmt|Phocinae|subfamily}}, comprising the "true" or [[earless seal|"earless" seals]].
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2007|author=Brian Keith Hall|title=Fins into Limbs|page=313
|passage='''Phocines''' anchor their hands by flexing their fingers, digging them into the substrate, and then pulling their body forward by elbow and shoulder flexion.}}

